	(descr "Lian Xin BS-CR2032-8 SMD CR2032 coin cell holder, LCSC C7498149, PPS body, gold contacts, 25.9x15.9x5.4 mm. Pad 1 + is the tail tab; pad 2 - is the round-end tab, under the body and visible through the end notch (EasyEDA numbers them the other way round). The 20 mm cell overhangs the body sides by 2 mm and is inside the courtyard. Via keepouts under the two spring-clip slots. https://wmsc.lcsc.com/wmsc/upload/file/pdf/v2/lcsc/2309251154_Lian-Xin-Technology-BS-CR2032-8_C7498149.pdf")
